(6816764, 1025509, 144365, '<td valign="top">#1<br/>I think this is the best shot in the challenge. Amazing detail in the feathers. I might have left more edge around the bird if it was empty space, I think that might have added to the morbidity of the image. Not only is it dead, but alone. I have a funny feeling regardless of the quality of the image, the DPC crowd will crucify you.</td>', '#1I think this is the best shot in the challenge. Amazing detail in the feathers. I might have left more edge around the bird if it was empty space, I think that might have added to the morbidity of the image. Not only is it dead, but alone. I have a funny feeling regardless of the quality of the image, the DPC crowd will crucify you.', '2012-07-13 01:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
