(6816993, 1025421, 54446, '<td valign="top">My favorite in this challenge.  It''s really a great cityscape/harborscape/seascape.  The best part of the image is the sky and clouds.  Your thin black border is very effective and I hate borders.  I expect this will be the blue ribbon.  10</td>', 'My favorite in this challenge.  It''s really a great cityscape/harborscape/seascape.  The best part of the image is the sky and clouds.  Your thin black border is very effective and I hate borders.  I expect this will be the blue ribbon.  10', '2012-07-13 10:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6816995, 1025542, 54446, '<td valign="top">This is a very fine downtown cityscape.  I truly love the perspective choice here.  And, the colors and exposure are magnificent.  Should be a ribbon contender.  9</td>', 'This is a very fine downtown cityscape.  I truly love the perspective choice here.  And, the colors and exposure are magnificent.  Should be a ribbon contender.  9', '2012-07-13 10:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6816997, 1025161, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very good composition.  Nice light and good color rendering.  9</td>', 'Very good composition.  Nice light and good color rendering.  9', '2012-07-13 10:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6817000, 1024923, 54446, '<td valign="top">Wonderful stone wall textures.  Also, great textures in the cross and doors.  The stone archway is very interesting.  Your ability to retain details in the shadows is amazing.   If I could change one thing, it would be to remove the very slight distraction of the lower middle flowers.  (but, I wouldn''t have taken the chance either in Basic)  I hope this will be a ribbon contender.  9</td>', 'Wonderful stone wall textures.  Also, great textures in the cross and doors.  The stone archway is very interesting.  Your ability to retain details in the shadows is amazing.   If I could change one thing, it would be to remove the very slight distraction of the lower middle flowers.  (but, I wouldn''t have taken the chance either in Basic)  I hope this will be a ribbon contender.  9', '2012-07-13 10:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6817003, 1025120, 54446, '<td valign="top">In general, this is a lighting situation that I would not expect to be possible to manage with a camera phone in Basic.  So, great job!  No detail lost in the shadows and a perfectly exposed sky.  8</td>', 'In general, this is a lighting situation that I would not expect to be possible to manage with a camera phone in Basic.  So, great job!  No detail lost in the shadows and a perfectly exposed sky.  8', '2012-07-13 10:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6817007, 1025320, 54446, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sky and water.  Excellent comp.  Perfect exposure.  Well done!  8</td>', 'Gorgeous sky and water.  Excellent comp.  Perfect exposure.  Well done!  8', '2012-07-13 10:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6817008, 1025113, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very clever to use a magnifying device to create a macro scene, which could then be captured with a wide angle camera phone.   Great job!  Wish I had thought of this.  You''ve overcome the inherent weakness of camera phones.   8</td>', 'Very clever to use a magnifying device to create a macro scene, which could then be captured with a wide angle camera phone.   Great job!  Wish I had thought of this.  You''ve overcome the inherent weakness of camera phones.   8', '2012-07-13 10:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
