(6819230, 1025536, 144365, '<td valign="top">#2, tied with another.<br/>Ahh, the number was left there. Thought I deleted it. <br/>In what was tantamount to a free study, many of entries seemed bereft of quality. Maybe they put no effort because of the restrictions on the camera. <br/> <br/>Anyways, I rated this higher than I normally would because it appears real thought went into the composition and execution even though it''s not normally my cup of tea in free study''esque challenges.</td>', '#2, tied with another.Ahh, the number was left there. Thought I deleted it. In what was tantamount to a free study, many of entries seemed bereft of quality. Maybe they put no effort because of the restrictions on the camera.  Anyways, I rated this higher than I normally would because it appears real thought went into the composition and execution even though it''s not normally my cup of tea in free study''esque challenges.', '2012-07-17 00:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6819231, 1025495, 144365, '<td valign="top">#2, tied with another.<br/>In what was tantamount to a free study, many of entries seemed bereft of quality. Maybe they put no effort because of the restrictions on the camera. <br/> <br/>Anyways, I rated this higher than I normally would because it appears real thought went into the composition and execution even though it''s not normally my cup of tea in free study''esque challenges.<br/> <br/>Left the same comment with the other #2 vote. Normally I would write something different, but both entries are really similar, thus warrant the same comment.</td>', '#2, tied with another.In what was tantamount to a free study, many of entries seemed bereft of quality. Maybe they put no effort because of the restrictions on the camera.  Anyways, I rated this higher than I normally would because it appears real thought went into the composition and execution even though it''s not normally my cup of tea in free study''esque challenges. Left the same comment with the other #2 vote. Normally I would write something different, but both entries are really similar, thus warrant the same comment.', '2012-07-17 00:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6819232, 1025235, 144365, '<td valign="top">#3, tied with another.<br/>I should point out I only have three entries ahead of this one.<br/> <br/>This photo is lacking something. Maybe the other side of the door, a horse in the paddock, or rancher somewhere in there. Maybe even more of the door showing so that the hay floor stands out on the right. I would have liked to something tie the title to the photo a little tighter. That being said, I think real thought went into the setup, and it''s pretty sharp, so I ranked this higher than I normally would.</td>', '#3, tied with another.I should point out I only have three entries ahead of this one. This photo is lacking something. Maybe the other side of the door, a horse in the paddock, or rancher somewhere in there. Maybe even more of the door showing so that the hay floor stands out on the right. I would have liked to something tie the title to the photo a little tighter. That being said, I think real thought went into the setup, and it''s pretty sharp, so I ranked this higher than I normally would.', '2012-07-17 00:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
