(6820548, 1025540, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love seeing the low-hanging cloud under the top of the tower.  Your phone does a nice job with a somewhat tricky exposure (and/or you know how to adjust settings to manage that).</td>', 'Love seeing the low-hanging cloud under the top of the tower.  Your phone does a nice job with a somewhat tricky exposure (and/or you know how to adjust settings to manage that).', '2012-07-18 10:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
