(6820553, 1025052, 65234, '<td valign="top">Heh.  Pretty cute.  A paw on the toy would have been out of this world, but I realize cats are not always cooperative models.</td>', 'Heh.  Pretty cute.  A paw on the toy would have been out of this world, but I realize cats are not always cooperative models.', '2012-07-18 10:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6820555, 1025331, 65234, '<td valign="top">How very random.  Nicely lit.</td>', 'How very random.  Nicely lit.', '2012-07-18 10:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6820557, 1025546, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of subject; Queen Anne''s Lace has such nice structure.  Looks like the light was interesting, too.  But the processing (phone filter, I''m guessing) is kind of cartoonish for my taste.</td>', 'I like your choice of subject; Queen Anne''s Lace has such nice structure.  Looks like the light was interesting, too.  But the processing (phone filter, I''m guessing) is kind of cartoonish for my taste.', '2012-07-18 10:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6820566, 1024960, 65234, '<td valign="top">Whatever happened to not biting the hand that feeds you?  Maybe biting arms is OK ;-). A bit dark, but then the subject could be considered rather dark.</td>', 'Whatever happened to not biting the hand that feeds you?  Maybe biting arms is OK ;-). A bit dark, but then the subject could be considered rather dark.', '2012-07-18 10:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6820580, 1025331, 63244, '<td valign="top">Susan is looking a bit provocative in this position.....''lil hussy! LOL!  Your camera is like mine...takes nice photos, but the sharpness isn''t tack sharp all of the time. I like this one!</td>', 'Susan is looking a bit provocative in this position.....''lil hussy! LOL!  Your camera is like mine...takes nice photos, but the sharpness isn''t tack sharp all of the time. I like this one!', '2012-07-18 11:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6820582, 1025545, 63244, '<td valign="top">Eeeeaaaak! For whatever reason, this reminds me of the movie the birds and I feel like this thing is going to eat me!!<br/>Not the sharpest shot and a bit more centered than I would prefer, but the initial reaction was there, thus it elicits emotion, which many photos do not! I''ll give Cujo bird a 5.</td>', 'Eeeeaaaak! For whatever reason, this reminds me of the movie the birds and I feel like this thing is going to eat me!!Not the sharpest shot and a bit more centered than I would prefer, but the initial reaction was there, thus it elicits emotion, which many photos do not! I''ll give Cujo bird a 5.', '2012-07-18 11:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
