(6821163, 1025543, 77185, '<td valign="top">Really nice colours in this, especially above the roll where it''s not blown out. A rather unusual subject which is interesting! The shadow in the upper right corner bothers me a little, would maybe have used a slightly tighter crop to get rid of it. I''m curious as to why the hues are different below the roll, is this due to the lighting, or because it was taken with phone?</td>', 'Really nice colours in this, especially above the roll where it''s not blown out. A rather unusual subject which is interesting! The shadow in the upper right corner bothers me a little, would maybe have used a slightly tighter crop to get rid of it. I''m curious as to why the hues are different below the roll, is this due to the lighting, or because it was taken with phone?', '2012-07-19 09:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
