(6823350, 1025418, 141367, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the great comments, I didn''t think it would score great but it was a fun shot and I assumed it would be very different. I have the Iphone and a lifeproof case which is air tight in up to 6 feet of water. My wife, my son and I were on vacation in Orlando and spent a lot of time in the pool. I got a lot of views and great comments on this shot. I appreciate everyone''s kind words and support. I haven''t entered a shot in a contest in a while, but this recharged the DPC battery. Hopefully I enter a many more challenges in the future. Thanks again everyone.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for the great comments, I didn''t think it would score great but it was a fun shot and I assumed it would be very different. I have the Iphone and a lifeproof case which is air tight in up to 6 feet of water. My wife, my son and I were on vacation in Orlando and spent a lot of time in the pool. I got a lot of views and great comments on this shot. I appreciate everyone''s kind words and support. I haven''t entered a shot in a contest in a while, but this recharged the DPC battery. Hopefully I enter a many more challenges in the future. Thanks again everyone.', '2012-07-21 01:06:51.000000', NULL, 0),
