(7265072, 1025428, 96311, '<td valign="top">Just on a note on this, i sent the wrong file the first time by mistake (uknowingly the way it was transfered from the phone !) after realising my image was d''qed i did submit the original but was told the d''q was unable to be undone :-(</td>', 'Just on a note on this, i sent the wrong file the first time by mistake (uknowingly the way it was transfered from the phone !) after realising my image was d''qed i did submit the original but was told the d''q was unable to be undone :-(', '2014-09-22 10:30:58.000000', NULL, 0),
